# ............................................................
# Contours take their name from the elevation setting
# Using ele>0 only avoids useless lines at the ocean, but
# we will not get lines for deep canyons, too. So only ignore
# the 0 contour line.
# ............................................................
contour=elevation & ele ~ '\d*[123456789]00' & (ele > 0 | ele < 0)	# match 1 or more repetition digits 100 200 300 ...
 	{ name '${ele|conv:m=>ft}';  }
    [0x21 resolution 21] 

